<https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalIdentifierType/iscc> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "International Standard Content Code (ISCC) <https://iscc.io/> is a content-derived identifier standardized by ISO 24138 <https://www.iso.org/standard/77899.html> for identifying digital assets. ISCC can be used in conjunction with other schemes, such as DOI, ISAN, ISBN, ISRC, ISSN and ISWC. A standard ISCC-CODE is build from multiple ISCC-UNITs. Each unit serve a different purpose. An ISCC-CODE typically look like ISCC:KACT4EBWK27737D2AYCJRAL5Z36G76RFRMO4554RU26HZ4ORJGIVHDI."@en .
